+"Ctl&gt;\" and \"&lt;Ctrl&gt;\". If you set the option to the special string "
+"\"disabled\", then there will be no keybinding for this action."
+msgstr ""
+
+#: ../src/metacity.schemas.in.h:134
+msgid ""
